title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the Nazi SA, nationalist Stahlhelm, the Republican - SPD Reichsbanner, and our own Rotfrontkämpferbund (RFB). In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing civil war levels, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We must do something to oppose the fascists in the streets.

- @battle: Test our shock units in battle against the enemy.
- @arm_rfb: Increase training and armaments for the Reichsbanner.
- @antifa_training: Train union members to fight as part of Antifaschiste Aktion.
- @union_recruiting: Rally workers from the unions we influence to join us.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @truce_rfb: Try to make peace with the RFB.
- @easy_discard

@battle
title: We will test our forces against the enemy. 
view-if: rfb_militancy > 0.1 

Many Rotfrontkampferbund members are eager to take the fight to the enemy. Where will we direct our members?

- @attack_rb_rally
- @attack_sa_rally

@attack_rb_rally
unavailable-subtitle: We have signed a truce with the Reichsbanner
choose-if: kpd_truce == 0
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.03; rdb_strength -= 50; rb_strength -= 50; sa_strength += 50; spd_relation -= 10; z_relation -= 10; workers_spd -= 5*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent);

We have disrupted a Reichsbanner rally, and have shown the workers that the real representatives of the working class reject their organizations.

@attack_sa_rally
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.03; rfb_strength -= 50; sa_strength -= 50; workers_nsdap -= 5*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent); spd_relation -= 5 if spd_party_leader == "Wels";

We have disrupted an SA rally, and have shown the workers how weak the Nazis really are. 

@arm_rfb
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rfb_militarization_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_militancy += 0.06; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_strength += 100 if socialism >= 60; sa_strength += 50; z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode 

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the RFB.

[? if historical_mode : The Center Party decries the militarization of the Reichsbanner, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@antifa_training
view-if: antifa_formed == 1
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.03; rfb_strength += 200; sa_strength += 50; 
max-visits: 3

As part of Antifaschiste Aktion, we are increasing coordination between the RFB and the unions, and many union members want to become more involved.

@union_recruiting
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough influence within the union movement to rally the workers like this.
choose-if: adgb_influence >= 50 or rgo_strength >= 50
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.05; sa_strength += 50; rfb_strength += 75; adgb_influence -= 10 

We recruit radical workers of the union movement into the RFB, at the expense of influence among the unions.

@peace
on-arrival: rfb_militancy -= 0.02; rfb_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1

By not fighting, the strength of the RFB atrophies. Pacifists in the party are gaining the upper hand.

@truce_rfb
choose-if: spd_relation >= 45
view-if: kpd_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The SPD is not interested.
on-arrival: kpd_truce = 1; spd_relation += 5; rfb_strength += 50; rb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50;

We have made at least a temporary truce with the SPD, so that our respective paramilitaries will stop fighting.
